      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1912-04-20_WidnesExaminer_art0067" n="art0067">
        <head>EAST NOTTINGHAM ELECTION.</head>
        <p>EAST NOTTINGHAM ELECTION.</p>
        <p>NOTABLE WEDDING AT PENKETH.</p>
        <p>MISS PARKER MARRIED TO THE REV. E. J. GAWNE.</p>
        <p>- • ,rt 7 ,-.." ~. ''`..,...5v,1,4-I,,tr, ~.4....., - ' .-, , - , , , • • '',.-‘ ' ' '‘' •' ' ' ~',` •,' • .'• ".;‘,•.;''," , ) _ "," '.''''' ' : ' t':',.. ,* • '••:',• ~ ''),,,,,,,, i' , •Nttx„l„,, ,‘',''',:',,,`, ,',‘, ';,. ' , ",, . • '4,`"„*--•tf, ~..to :1„'',,4: ' &lt;:e: 4 ' :""'t: t ' , ' ^ ' 1,,' '' ‘• ,' s ^ ~tik:, ~ ' ',`",'' ' '• . ' ‘, , • „'.: , / a'''' '''',l* ,0,,,,, . ' ! • . , :' 4' ' ' l'e.', "-':'' " . • ""- z ~,' ~fr.._'-;.t. '.;' '. '' ' ~,t*:-‘ ,r.-. -- 0 4:, ; ' * ~, , - 4!:1•,, ' ;., '' , • I ... , , - *,. ~.... ~, , _ ,-- eillpilt ,i , - ,1 -; ,',&amp;.',.1.:,,,,,i • ;','..,.7.,, , , ~ ~,,,.., , '' ' =l_ _ ' t I i t&lt; t, I , 1 .., , , , ties, Photo Bir , . ~,</p>
