      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1912-04-20_WidnesExaminer_art0114" n="art0114">
        <head>FRANCE'S TRIBUTE TO QUEEN VICTORIA.</head>
        <p>FRANCE'S TRIBUTE TO QUEEN VICTORIA.</p>
        <p>The fetes arranged at Nice last Week, in bottom- of the unveiling, by M. Poincare, the French Premier, of the statue to Queen Vic- toria, were of the most elaborate ,order. Several thousand French and British s'Oldiers and sailors taking part in a grand naval and</p>
        <p>military review. The statce—a photograph of which we produce above—showe her Majesty accepting floral offerings from figures representing Nice, Cannes, Menton., and Grasse.</p>
